WEBVTT

01:33.429 --> 01:35.700
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.760 --> 01:38.060
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:38.129 --> 01:41.030
(Episode 19)

01:57.679 --> 01:59.549
Come on, dinner time.

01:59.720 --> 02:00.420
Come on.

02:00.489 --> 02:01.789
Are they your cats?

02:02.920 --> 02:04.159
They're stray cats.

02:04.929 --> 02:06.429
They have a lot of guts. They always come to visit.

02:06.489 --> 02:07.159
Yes.

02:08.530 --> 02:09.260
This isn't right.

02:09.329 --> 02:10.599
- You're not eating? - Lai Fu can usually eat...

02:10.659 --> 02:11.530
half of this.

02:13.429 --> 02:14.470
His name is Lai Fu?

02:14.730 --> 02:15.400
Yes.

02:15.840 --> 02:17.300
- Jiang Yi named it. - Lai Fu.

02:17.970 --> 02:18.639
Lai Fu.

02:18.710 --> 02:19.509
- Lai Fu. - Eat up.

02:19.609 --> 02:21.069
Instructor, let me take a look.

02:23.310 --> 02:24.109
Lai Fu.

02:24.509 --> 02:25.550
What's wrong with you today?

02:26.150 --> 02:27.449
Why aren't you eating?

02:27.879 --> 02:28.550
Lai Fu.

02:30.250 --> 02:30.979
Dr. Xu.

02:31.150 --> 02:31.849
Take a look for me.

02:31.919 --> 02:33.250
Is Lai Fu sick? Here.

02:33.319 --> 02:33.990
Let me see.

02:34.050 --> 02:34.789
Jiang Yi.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.289
Dr. Xu is not a veterinarian.

02:36.359 --> 02:37.819
They're doctors. It's the same.

02:37.889 --> 02:39.460
He's my cat. I'll check him out with her.

02:39.530 --> 02:40.830
Is he in shock?

02:42.530 --> 02:43.800
I don't see any external injuries.

02:43.930 --> 02:45.129
Let me see if there's any weird odor.

02:45.199 --> 02:46.530
Don't have an upset stomach.

02:47.000 --> 02:47.770
Let me take a look.

02:47.870 --> 02:48.639
His mouth.

02:49.500 --> 02:50.199
His mouth is fine.

02:50.270 --> 02:52.370
Let me see if his little paws have problems.

02:53.569 --> 02:54.669
Smell it. Is there a problem?

02:55.780 --> 02:56.639
They're fine.

02:56.840 --> 02:59.009
I think he's just in shock.

03:01.520 --> 03:02.720
You've been checking on him for so long.

03:03.349 --> 03:04.520
Do you see anything wrong with him?

03:06.720 --> 03:07.520
Chief.

03:09.520 --> 03:10.490
It's nothing serious.

03:11.490 --> 03:12.689
I think he'll need to rest for a few days.

03:14.689 --> 03:15.430
I think...

03:15.560 --> 03:16.629
you should adopt it.

03:16.930 --> 03:18.400
Your place is big and spacious.

03:18.470 --> 03:19.470
It's more suitable for you.

03:20.270 --> 03:21.639
Do I need to keep a cat just because my place is spacious?

03:21.970 --> 03:23.400
I think it's good for him to come...

03:23.470 --> 03:24.439
and go freely.

03:25.210 --> 03:27.039
Aren't you lonely by yourself?

03:29.710 --> 03:30.939
I don't want to get attached.

03:33.750 --> 03:35.020
Cats have shorter lifespans than humans.

03:35.449 --> 03:36.680
I just don't want the hassle.

03:37.250 --> 03:38.520
If I work overtime for a few days,

03:38.590 --> 03:39.349
what will happen to him?

03:41.720 --> 03:43.590
You're too pessimistic.

03:45.490 --> 03:46.689
Chief Song has a say in this.

03:46.759 --> 03:47.729
He has Xiao Meng.

03:48.500 --> 03:50.060
Listen to what he has to say about Xiao Meng.

03:50.129 --> 03:51.359
He has the most say in this.

03:52.169 --> 03:53.270
I'm going to send him away.

03:57.039 --> 03:58.439
Why are you sending him away?

03:58.840 --> 03:59.909
Don't you have any feelings...

03:59.970 --> 04:01.639
for the things around you?

04:02.780 --> 04:03.539
You're right.

04:10.780 --> 04:12.250
You shouldn't have said that.

04:12.319 --> 04:13.650
You misunderstood him.

04:14.520 --> 04:16.159
He's good to Xiao Meng.

04:16.319 --> 04:17.759
He even trains him.

04:17.819 --> 04:18.490
Yes.

04:18.560 --> 04:19.430
He told us...

04:19.490 --> 04:22.030
he's sending him to the dog search and rescue base...

04:22.400 --> 04:24.970
to join us on missions in the future.

04:25.599 --> 04:27.869
- Yes. - We can keep each other company.

04:27.929 --> 04:28.599
We won't be lonely.

04:33.270 --> 04:34.640
Lai Fu.

04:38.309 --> 04:39.809
Why aren't you eating today?

05:16.720 --> 05:17.479
Ye Zi.

05:19.789 --> 05:20.890
Don't be nervous, Ye Zi.

05:20.950 --> 05:22.960
- Mr. Wu. - I just happened to pass by.

05:24.520 --> 05:26.059
What's wrong? Are you tired?

05:26.130 --> 05:26.960
I'm fine.

05:28.289 --> 05:29.130
Are you hungry?

05:29.200 --> 05:30.099
Let's have dinner together.

05:30.159 --> 05:30.900
It's okay.

05:30.960 --> 05:31.929
Thank you, Mr. Wu.

05:32.130 --> 05:32.900
Look at you.

05:32.970 --> 05:34.169
You're being so polite to me.

05:34.229 --> 05:35.999
I'm having dinner with a friend.

05:37.070 --> 05:37.900
All right then.

05:37.999 --> 05:39.570
Go home early after work then.

05:39.710 --> 05:40.909
Don't stay too late.

06:02.999 --> 06:03.729
Come in.

06:06.169 --> 06:06.900
Mr. Meng.

06:07.599 --> 06:08.440
You can go home now.

06:09.539 --> 06:10.299
No.

06:10.369 --> 06:12.809
Mr. Wu from Qinghe Art Museum called again.

06:13.169 --> 06:14.010
He wants to have a meal with you.

06:16.840 --> 06:18.010
Okay, I got it.

07:34.749 --> 07:35.559
Take care.

07:35.989 --> 07:36.960
Thank you for coming.

07:56.039 --> 07:57.679
Has the boss not been here these days too?

07:58.010 --> 07:59.080
He hasn't been here for a long time.

07:59.150 --> 08:01.010
He's very busy with work.

08:01.080 --> 08:01.749
Besides,

08:01.820 --> 08:03.549
he's just running the bar for fun.

08:03.749 --> 08:04.880
If he can come a few times a month,

08:04.950 --> 08:06.119
that's already a lot.

08:06.390 --> 08:07.049
What's the matter?

08:07.119 --> 08:07.950
Do you miss him?

08:08.720 --> 08:09.890
What are you talking about?

08:09.989 --> 08:10.659
The glass.

08:12.030 --> 08:13.530
I'm just kidding.

08:13.590 --> 08:15.530
I hope he comes more often and makes a fuss.

08:15.599 --> 08:16.499
That's more interesting.

08:27.210 --> 08:28.010
Hello.

08:28.409 --> 08:29.539
Is Dr. Xu still here?

08:29.609 --> 08:31.340
Dr. Xu isn't at the hospital during this period of time.

08:31.409 --> 08:32.479
She's stationed at the fire station...

08:32.549 --> 08:34.080
with the joint rescue and medical team.

08:42.590 --> 08:43.820
(Forge ahead)

08:43.889 --> 08:44.660
Get ready.

09:09.119 --> 09:09.779
Song Yan.

09:10.479 --> 09:11.149
Help me figure this out.

09:11.220 --> 09:12.790
I really can't get this shift scheduled.

09:12.889 --> 09:14.090
It's your problem.

09:14.149 --> 09:14.989
You take care of it.

09:15.090 --> 09:16.060
Help me.

09:16.119 --> 09:17.720
I'm too confused.

09:17.790 --> 09:19.129
I can't figure it out.

09:22.399 --> 09:23.200
Xu Qin.

09:25.869 --> 09:27.330
This is the emergency medical information.

09:27.399 --> 09:28.300
I found it. Take a look.

09:28.369 --> 09:29.040
Thank you.

09:29.099 --> 09:29.769
It's okay.

09:49.790 --> 09:50.519
What's wrong?

09:51.930 --> 09:53.160
You're drinking from my cup.

09:56.399 --> 09:57.330
I'm sorry.

09:57.759 --> 09:59.170
I thought you poured it for me.

09:59.769 --> 10:00.570
This is yours.

10:12.849 --> 10:13.710
Why are you laughing?

10:15.749 --> 10:17.379
I really can't stand it anymore.

10:18.550 --> 10:19.749
What can't you stand?

10:21.090 --> 10:22.560
I can't stand you...

10:22.690 --> 10:23.889
You...

10:24.220 --> 10:25.430
No, well...

10:26.690 --> 10:27.830
The team members...

10:27.889 --> 10:29.599
haven't had a break.

10:29.660 --> 10:31.359
They must go home to see their parents,

10:31.430 --> 10:32.470
wife,

10:32.529 --> 10:34.470
kids, and family.

10:34.570 --> 10:35.599
We have to give them reasonable time...

10:35.670 --> 10:37.599
to go home to see them.

10:37.670 --> 10:38.670
It's dry in autumn.

10:39.310 --> 10:40.440
There's a high incidence...

10:40.970 --> 10:42.310
of fires, car accidents, and all sorts of incidents.

10:43.040 --> 10:44.540
We have to be dispatched over a dozen times a day.

10:44.879 --> 10:45.810
We don't have enough people at all.

10:46.680 --> 10:47.550
If I can't go,

10:47.609 --> 10:49.249
I'll invite them to come to me.

10:49.420 --> 10:51.550
If nothing else works, let's bring...

10:51.649 --> 10:52.920
the families to the fire station...

10:53.050 --> 10:54.519
and have a get-together, right?

10:54.590 --> 10:56.320
You're not using your brain when spending money.

10:56.590 --> 10:57.590
How much...

10:57.759 --> 10:58.889
will the plane tickets and accommodation cost?

11:00.229 --> 11:01.389
Is the family building big enough?

11:02.300 --> 11:03.160
Besides,

11:03.300 --> 11:04.930
not all relatives can come.

11:05.629 --> 11:07.229
Your family can come. Mine can't.

11:07.830 --> 11:09.070
It's worse for those who don't get to see them.

11:09.239 --> 11:11.399
You two have each other...

11:12.070 --> 11:13.810
and I don't even have anyone.

11:14.440 --> 11:15.109
Well...

11:18.440 --> 11:20.349
I know the station is on a budget.

11:20.550 --> 11:22.019
If it really doesn't work,

11:22.080 --> 11:23.019
I'll pay for it myself, okay?

11:23.080 --> 11:23.920
Stop.

11:30.619 --> 11:31.720
Come to think of it,

11:32.560 --> 11:33.629
you're becoming...

11:34.389 --> 11:35.700
like an instructor now.

11:36.930 --> 11:38.869
Why do you sound so sarcastic?

11:38.930 --> 11:40.529
Is that a compliment or an insult?

11:42.670 --> 11:43.769
I have an idea.

11:44.700 --> 11:45.509
- How much will it cost? - How much will it cost?

11:47.639 --> 11:48.369
Nothing.

11:48.440 --> 11:51.710
Riding our red chariot

11:51.810 --> 11:55.180
Wherever disaster strikes, I'll be there

11:55.420 --> 11:58.550
Our vow is to risk our lives

11:58.849 --> 12:02.060
Our mission is to walk through fire

12:02.290 --> 12:05.629
I charge to the rising flames

12:05.759 --> 12:09.099
I'll hold up the landslide

12:09.160 --> 12:10.729
Go forward

12:10.830 --> 12:12.399
Firefighters

12:12.570 --> 12:15.800
Great love composes heroic songs

12:15.970 --> 12:19.040
Great love composes heroic songs

12:22.279 --> 12:23.239
Deputy Chief.

12:23.310 --> 12:24.680
The assembly is complete. Please give your command.

12:24.840 --> 12:26.109
- Let's eat. - Yes.

12:27.649 --> 12:28.310
Everyone gets one.

12:28.609 --> 12:30.080
Turn right.

12:30.950 --> 12:31.619
Squad One.

12:31.680 --> 12:32.649
Turn left. Bring them in.

12:36.359 --> 12:37.519
Squad Two, turn left.

12:41.129 --> 12:41.830
What's the matter?

12:41.889 --> 12:42.899
Why is the food different today?

12:42.960 --> 12:43.960
The dishes are good.

12:44.330 --> 12:45.970
- The dishes are good today. - What's over there?

12:46.029 --> 12:46.930
Over there.

12:48.070 --> 12:48.970
Stuffed bitter melon.

12:50.070 --> 12:51.570
We have a feast today.

12:51.639 --> 12:52.710
The dishes are...

12:52.840 --> 12:53.540
What a feast.

12:53.609 --> 12:54.310
Life is so good today.

12:54.369 --> 12:55.070
They remembered to add more dishes.

12:55.139 --> 12:56.009
- It smells so good. - Have a seat.

12:56.340 --> 12:57.009
Pi Pi.

12:58.080 --> 12:59.009
Sweet and sour pork.

12:59.080 --> 12:59.950
Let's eat.

13:09.590 --> 13:11.160
This sweet and sour pork is amazing.

13:11.359 --> 13:12.690
It tastes like my mom's cooking.

13:13.090 --> 13:13.889
Instructor.

13:15.430 --> 13:16.899
If I remember correctly,

13:17.430 --> 13:18.660
I don't think our chef can make...

13:18.729 --> 13:20.229
this stuffed bitter gourd.

13:20.629 --> 13:21.330
And this...

13:21.399 --> 13:22.999
This technique of putting soy sauce on top...

13:23.800 --> 13:24.470
of the stuffed bitter gourd...

13:24.800 --> 13:26.440
is so similar to my wife's.

13:27.109 --> 13:27.840
It's true.

13:28.040 --> 13:28.710
Try it.

13:28.769 --> 13:29.910
- Instructor. - It's a specialty dish.

13:30.310 --> 13:31.910
This dish is amazing.

13:32.509 --> 13:33.379
It's exactly the same as the one...

13:33.450 --> 13:34.810
my grandpa made for me when I was little.

13:36.050 --> 13:36.779
Instructor.

13:36.920 --> 13:38.249
There's no sugar in the kung pao chicken.

13:38.450 --> 13:39.619
And the peanuts are half-cooked,

13:39.690 --> 13:40.590
just how I like them.

13:40.920 --> 13:41.690
Only...

13:41.920 --> 13:43.060
my dad knows this.

13:43.389 --> 13:44.920
What exactly is going on?

13:45.290 --> 13:46.590
Your dad made that.

13:48.430 --> 13:49.330
My dad made this?

13:49.430 --> 13:51.029
It's true. Your dad made it.

13:51.330 --> 13:52.029
Look at this.

13:53.029 --> 13:53.869
The ribs...

13:54.470 --> 13:55.470
are your mom's cooking.

13:57.399 --> 13:58.369
This beef...

13:59.070 --> 14:00.210
was stir-fried by your dad.

14:00.810 --> 14:01.609
Han Xiang.

14:02.040 --> 14:03.009
The stuffed bitter melon...

14:04.009 --> 14:05.609
was made by your wife.

14:06.109 --> 14:07.649
Your wife made it.

14:07.879 --> 14:08.810
The fire station knows...

14:08.879 --> 14:10.680
that the firefighters...

14:10.979 --> 14:12.550
haven't been home for a long time.

14:12.989 --> 14:14.389
We can't have home-cooked meals,

14:15.119 --> 14:17.519
so they especially contacted your families.

14:18.019 --> 14:20.090
They all know what you like to eat.

14:20.160 --> 14:22.330
They cooked them for you in your hometowns...

14:22.399 --> 14:24.200
and they got them especially delivered.

14:24.629 --> 14:25.460
Is it good?

14:25.800 --> 14:27.369
- It's good. - Yes.

14:27.629 --> 14:28.399
We don't just have these food.

14:29.800 --> 14:30.899
They also recorded videos for you.

14:31.399 --> 14:32.440
Let's watch the big screen together.

14:34.769 --> 14:35.710
Da Peng.

14:36.210 --> 14:37.840
Your chief and instructor...

14:37.910 --> 14:40.279
said your training is very hard.

14:40.550 --> 14:41.849
They're afraid you'll miss home,

14:42.149 --> 14:43.379
so they asked me to make you...

14:43.450 --> 14:44.479
some hometown dishes.

14:45.519 --> 14:46.590
When you were at home,

14:46.649 --> 14:48.190
you liked to eat ribs.

14:48.489 --> 14:50.060
I told your dad to go to the market...

14:50.119 --> 14:50.790
to buy fresh ones.

14:50.889 --> 14:51.989
I made them for you.

14:52.930 --> 14:53.660
Training is hard,

14:53.729 --> 14:55.129
so you need to eat more meat.

14:55.629 --> 14:56.430
Train your body...

14:56.499 --> 14:57.660
to be stronger.

14:58.229 --> 14:59.269
When you were at home,

14:59.330 --> 15:00.599
you were too thin.

15:09.840 --> 15:10.540
By the way,

15:11.410 --> 15:13.109
you have to use the facial mask often.

15:13.349 --> 15:14.710
When I saw your photo last time,

15:14.910 --> 15:15.779
you were so tan.

15:15.849 --> 15:17.149
You looked like a monkey.

15:17.320 --> 15:18.249
If you go on like this,

15:18.320 --> 15:19.720
it will be hard to find a wife.

15:21.450 --> 15:22.259
Do you hear me?

15:24.889 --> 15:25.560
Honey.

15:26.029 --> 15:27.359
I made stuffed bitter gourd for you.

15:27.430 --> 15:28.290
That's my wife.

15:28.359 --> 15:29.629
Look. That's my wife.

15:31.229 --> 15:32.599
Guangxi is too far from Yancheng.

15:32.670 --> 15:34.269
I put a lot of ice in it,

15:34.470 --> 15:36.170
so it won't spoil when it arrives.

15:36.999 --> 15:37.940
You're fighting fire every day.

15:37.999 --> 15:39.310
You go through so many hardships and risk your life.

15:39.410 --> 15:40.310
It's so tiring.

15:40.440 --> 15:41.670
Have some bitter gourd to cool down.

15:43.639 --> 15:45.410
Everything is fine at home.

15:45.479 --> 15:46.310
Don't worry.

15:46.609 --> 15:47.450
With me here,

15:47.680 --> 15:48.479
we're good.

15:49.019 --> 15:50.479
Mom and Dad are doing well too.

15:51.050 --> 15:52.119
Let me tell you something.

15:54.149 --> 15:55.759
Baby can say Dad now.

15:57.519 --> 15:58.759
- Dad. - Listen.

15:58.820 --> 15:59.790
Do you hear that?

16:00.190 --> 16:00.859
Dad, I love you.

16:00.930 --> 16:01.830
That's my son.

16:02.999 --> 16:04.129
My son.

16:04.330 --> 16:05.099
I love you.

16:05.160 --> 16:05.970
I love you.

16:06.029 --> 16:07.029
Did you hear that?

16:08.930 --> 16:10.300
Take care of yourself.

16:11.769 --> 16:12.910
Listen to your instructor.

16:13.009 --> 16:13.910
Train hard.

16:17.239 --> 16:18.040
Gao Yu.

16:18.310 --> 16:19.450
I sent you the cola chicken wings...

16:19.509 --> 16:20.479
I made for you.

16:20.550 --> 16:21.580
I put in a lot of ice.

16:21.649 --> 16:22.649
It won't go bad.

16:23.149 --> 16:23.820
Look.

16:23.879 --> 16:26.290
The peaches from our hometown this year are here.

16:26.450 --> 16:27.649
They're so fresh.

16:27.920 --> 16:29.460
I wanted to pick more...

16:29.519 --> 16:31.019
and send a few boxes for your team.

16:31.960 --> 16:33.259
But your chief and instructor...

16:33.330 --> 16:34.560
just wouldn't allow it.

16:34.629 --> 16:36.160
They said they couldn't accept gifts...

16:36.229 --> 16:37.629
from people.

16:38.759 --> 16:40.099
Is my own child...

16:40.170 --> 16:42.399
eating food from his own home a gift from people?

16:42.570 --> 16:43.369
Besides,

16:43.700 --> 16:45.910
I'm also a firefighter's family.

16:46.570 --> 16:47.440
Next time,

16:47.509 --> 16:48.840
I'll send you more peaches...

16:49.239 --> 16:51.310
and make them accept them.

16:52.139 --> 16:54.149
Share it with your teammates.

16:54.710 --> 16:55.379
Pi Pi.

16:55.450 --> 16:57.149
Look at your unserious parents.

16:57.550 --> 16:58.479
They don't care about you.

16:58.550 --> 16:59.649
They're never home.

17:00.389 --> 17:01.920
When they go on a business trip,

17:02.050 --> 17:03.519
they don't come back for months.

17:03.590 --> 17:04.960
Your parents aren't home,

17:05.160 --> 17:06.729
so I'll cook for you.

17:07.729 --> 17:08.930
Look at these sausages.

17:09.029 --> 17:10.560
I made them fresh.

17:10.830 --> 17:12.329
I'm afraid I wouldn't make them in time,

17:12.569 --> 17:15.229
so I used a hair dryer yesterday to blow on them the whole day.

17:15.940 --> 17:16.839
I don't know...

17:16.940 --> 17:17.870
if it's the same taste...

17:17.940 --> 17:19.269
you liked when you were little.

17:22.410 --> 17:23.210
Lin Hao.

17:24.110 --> 17:25.440
Your parents aren't home.

17:26.049 --> 17:28.049
When your instructor called,

17:28.350 --> 17:29.650
I happened to answer it.

17:29.850 --> 17:31.850
He told me to cook something delicious for you.

17:32.049 --> 17:34.319
Coincidentally, we have preserved vegetables at home.

17:34.690 --> 17:36.759
Mr. Zhu's family at the east end of the village...

17:37.220 --> 17:38.289
happens to be slaughtering a pig.

17:39.130 --> 17:40.029
Iberian pigs.

17:41.160 --> 17:43.160
The meat is very fragrant.

17:45.729 --> 17:47.670
You must train hard in the team.

17:48.229 --> 17:49.799
Don't worry about us.

17:50.269 --> 17:51.640
Everything is fine at home.

17:51.769 --> 17:53.370
Look. Your grandpa is healthy, right?

17:53.440 --> 17:54.410
I'm full of energy, aren't I?

17:55.170 --> 17:57.640
Don't send money home anymore.

17:57.809 --> 17:59.479
We have enough food and clothes.

18:02.479 --> 18:03.549
When I was abroad,

18:03.920 --> 18:05.120
every once in a while,

18:05.380 --> 18:07.150
I really wanted to eat in Chinatown.

18:08.150 --> 18:09.190
I only realized later on...

18:10.019 --> 18:11.319
that it was because I was feeling homesick.

18:13.960 --> 18:14.930
In terms of feeling homesick,

18:15.630 --> 18:16.930
our stomachs are more honest than our hearts.

18:19.269 --> 18:20.170
Don't you think...

18:20.769 --> 18:22.539
that your idea stirs up too many emotions?

18:22.640 --> 18:23.640
There must be emotions...

18:24.499 --> 18:25.839
to be stirred up in the first place.

18:28.640 --> 18:29.440
It's not like you.

18:30.479 --> 18:31.279
What's the matter?

18:31.610 --> 18:32.610
You think I'm cold...

18:32.680 --> 18:33.680
and emotionless?

18:34.279 --> 18:35.249
I think you have emotions.

18:36.350 --> 18:37.749
It's just that some feelings...

18:38.150 --> 18:39.589
aren't that important to you.

18:40.450 --> 18:41.789
I don't think you're cold either.

18:43.420 --> 18:44.220
I still remember...

18:47.130 --> 18:47.960
Remember what?

18:51.829 --> 18:53.269
Tell me. What do you remember?

18:56.569 --> 18:58.200
I still remember how warm you were.

19:11.749 --> 19:13.890
Our elders recorded videos...

19:13.950 --> 19:14.890
and cooked for us.

19:14.950 --> 19:15.920
Shouldn't we record a video...

19:15.989 --> 19:17.620
to thank them too?

19:17.819 --> 19:19.289
- Yes. - Yes.

19:20.089 --> 19:20.759
Come on.

19:20.829 --> 19:22.559
Pull it far away.

19:23.029 --> 19:26.769
Three, two, one.

19:27.329 --> 19:33.009
- Thank you for the food you made! - Thank you for the food you made!

19:44.279 --> 19:47.319
(The Command Center is the base)

19:47.450 --> 19:48.690
Hello, 119. What's your emergency?

19:49.890 --> 19:51.160
Don't panic. Speak slowly.

19:52.019 --> 19:53.160
You and what?

19:53.759 --> 19:54.559
Grass mud...

19:55.559 --> 19:56.430
Why are you cursing me?

19:59.829 --> 20:00.970
An alpaca.

20:02.569 --> 20:03.370
What's the address?

20:05.799 --> 20:07.210
Happy Home, Lantian Road,

20:07.269 --> 20:09.170
Alley 50, Building 7, Unit 306.

20:09.440 --> 20:10.110
Okay, got it.

20:10.180 --> 20:10.839
Keep your phone available.

20:10.910 --> 20:11.579
We're on our way.

20:36.200 --> 20:37.200
Okay, don't move.

20:37.470 --> 20:38.200
Wait.

20:38.600 --> 20:39.339
Wait.

20:42.680 --> 20:43.410
Comrade.

20:43.479 --> 20:44.239
It's this house.

20:46.210 --> 20:46.880
Comrade.

20:46.950 --> 20:48.450
Hello, this is 119.

20:48.509 --> 20:49.479
How are you doing?

20:50.279 --> 20:51.350
I'm fine.

20:51.549 --> 20:53.350
Can you move? Can you open the door for us?

20:53.549 --> 20:54.549
I can't.

20:54.720 --> 20:56.390
If you can't move, we'll have to break down the door.

20:56.460 --> 20:57.190
Okay.

20:57.960 --> 20:58.860
We'll have to break down the door.

20:58.920 --> 20:59.589
Do it.

20:59.660 --> 21:00.430
Life is at stake.

21:00.529 --> 21:01.559
Ge Zheng, try it first.

21:10.640 --> 21:11.839
Jiang Yi, you do it.

21:25.989 --> 21:27.489
Everyone, stop looking. Go back.

21:28.390 --> 21:29.589
I knew...

21:29.720 --> 21:31.489
that Wu Xuan Yang would get into trouble sooner or later.

21:31.989 --> 21:34.489
He has a lot of weird pets at home.

21:34.890 --> 21:37.130
He has a horse or a goat...

21:37.200 --> 21:38.460
with a bad temper.

21:38.559 --> 21:40.470
He'll bite if you touch him a bit.

21:40.769 --> 21:42.069
He even has a lot...

21:42.130 --> 21:45.200
of lizards, spiders, and snakes at home.

21:45.569 --> 21:46.569
It's in the study.

21:46.640 --> 21:47.509
I saw them.

21:47.569 --> 21:48.509
It's so scary.

21:48.569 --> 21:50.309
Aren't people who have abnormal pets...

21:50.380 --> 21:52.009
mentally abnormal too?

21:52.279 --> 21:53.249
In the end, either something happens to him...

21:53.309 --> 21:54.210
or to someone else.

21:54.279 --> 21:54.950
Ma'am.

21:55.249 --> 21:56.350
You can't say that.

21:56.519 --> 21:57.749
Everyone has different hobbies.

21:58.180 --> 21:59.049
Hobbies?

21:59.549 --> 22:01.890
Keeping cats and dogs are hobbies.

22:02.049 --> 22:03.220
Keeping cold-blooded animals...

22:03.289 --> 22:04.759
indicates a mental problem.

22:05.089 --> 22:06.029
You're not aware.

22:06.190 --> 22:07.529
He doesn't usually leave his house...

22:07.589 --> 22:08.329
and stays indoors all the time.

22:08.390 --> 22:09.360
He doesn't go to work either.

22:09.630 --> 22:11.130
He just hangs out...

22:11.200 --> 22:12.769
with that hot-tempered alpaca,

22:12.829 --> 22:15.430
lizards, spiders, and snakes all the time.

22:15.999 --> 22:17.499
It's scary to even think about.

22:17.569 --> 22:19.410
It's causing our neighborhood's real estate prices to drop.

22:21.410 --> 22:22.779
Let me tell you,

22:23.009 --> 22:24.180
one time when he saw our dog,

22:24.239 --> 22:25.440
he got scared and ran away.

22:25.509 --> 22:26.279
Tell me.

22:26.350 --> 22:27.350
He's not even afraid...

22:27.410 --> 22:28.279
of cold-blooded animals.

22:28.350 --> 22:30.180
Why would he be afraid of our little dog?

22:30.450 --> 22:32.049
I think he just wants to extort from me.

22:32.789 --> 22:34.049
Your dog isn't leashed.

22:34.319 --> 22:35.089
Last time,

22:35.190 --> 22:36.360
it wasn't on a leash either, right?

22:37.089 --> 22:39.430
Look, it's so small and cute.

22:39.559 --> 22:40.559
It won't bite.

22:41.029 --> 22:41.829
Ma'am.

22:41.930 --> 22:42.999
You look so kind.

22:43.360 --> 22:45.160
Don't you also put labels on people behind their backs?

22:49.640 --> 22:50.470
Here's the thing.

22:50.670 --> 22:52.100
A dog must be leashed.

22:52.170 --> 22:53.539
It's the city's law and order regulation.

22:53.610 --> 22:54.839
Yes, that's the regulation.

22:56.039 --> 22:56.809
All right.

22:56.880 --> 22:57.839
I'll leash him from now on.

22:59.339 --> 23:00.079
I didn't expect...

23:00.150 --> 23:00.979
Chief Song to be someone...

23:01.049 --> 23:02.549
who tells people off without cursing.

23:04.549 --> 23:05.579
That's his specialty.

23:26.809 --> 23:27.569
All right.

23:32.039 --> 23:32.880
What's this smell?

23:32.950 --> 23:33.610
It stinks.

23:33.680 --> 23:34.380
How are you doing?

23:34.450 --> 23:35.210
Is there anywhere that you can't move?

23:35.279 --> 23:36.150
Are you hurt?

23:36.650 --> 23:37.450
I...

23:37.519 --> 23:38.549
I'm fine.

23:38.779 --> 23:39.789
Save Lu Lu first.

23:39.920 --> 23:41.089
Lu Lu. Where's Lu Lu?

23:42.089 --> 23:43.059
This is Lu Lu.

23:43.360 --> 23:45.789
She's a very gentle girl.

23:46.130 --> 23:46.860
Pi Pi, Ge Zheng, Da Peng.

23:46.930 --> 23:48.130
- You guys carry that side. - Yes.

23:48.229 --> 23:48.890
Let's hold it here.

23:48.960 --> 23:49.630
Get him out first.

23:49.700 --> 23:50.360
- Come on, slowly. - Slowly.

23:50.430 --> 23:52.059
- Slowly. - One, two, three, go.

23:54.170 --> 23:54.870
Come on, up.

23:55.600 --> 23:56.940
- Slowly. - Slowly.

23:56.999 --> 23:58.069
Be careful.

23:58.400 --> 23:59.140
Slowly.

24:03.440 --> 24:05.009
- Slowly. - Slowly.

24:05.910 --> 24:06.809
Get him out first.

24:07.009 --> 24:08.210
- Get him out first. - He's fine.

24:08.279 --> 24:08.950
This way.

24:09.009 --> 24:09.680
Are you okay?

24:09.979 --> 24:10.650
I'm fine.

24:10.720 --> 24:11.650
- Come on, this way. - This way.

24:14.549 --> 24:15.220
Where should we put...

24:15.289 --> 24:16.289
your alpaca?

24:16.360 --> 24:19.190
Just help me take her to that room.

24:19.360 --> 24:20.190
Lu Lu, right?

24:20.489 --> 24:21.729
Be good. Let's go back to the room.

24:23.660 --> 24:25.460
It stinks. Why did you spit?

24:27.970 --> 24:28.700
I already have her under control.

24:28.769 --> 24:29.640
- Lift her up. - Come on.

24:29.700 --> 24:30.839
- One, two, three. - Are you all right?

24:30.940 --> 24:32.100
- I'm fine. - Okay.

24:38.479 --> 24:39.309
My goodness.

24:43.720 --> 24:44.519
Yang Chi.

24:45.150 --> 24:46.519
This man doesn't seem to be feeling well.

24:46.890 --> 24:48.120
Sir, are you all right?

24:50.720 --> 24:51.460
Da Peng.

24:51.690 --> 24:52.720
Open the curtains and windows.

24:52.789 --> 24:53.630
- Let him get some air. - Okay.

24:55.360 --> 24:56.299
Dr. Xu.

24:56.360 --> 24:57.360
Please come up here quickly.

24:57.529 --> 24:58.200
Be quick.

24:58.360 --> 24:59.130
Got it. Let's go.

25:05.400 --> 25:06.410
Where do you feel unwell?

25:07.239 --> 25:08.210
My chest hurts.

25:08.269 --> 25:09.440
My throat hurts too.

25:10.940 --> 25:11.839
Does your shoulder hurt?

25:13.049 --> 25:13.850
Yes.

25:15.079 --> 25:17.019
- This area. Does it hurt? - It hurts.

25:17.079 --> 25:17.749
Does it hurt here?

25:17.819 --> 25:18.579
It hurts here too.

25:22.049 --> 25:23.190
Is it a stabbing pain or dull pain?

25:23.319 --> 25:24.589
A stabbing pain.

25:26.289 --> 25:27.589
Come on, relax.

25:27.930 --> 25:28.729
Relax.

25:36.569 --> 25:37.370
What's the blood pressure?

25:38.039 --> 25:39.870
It's 147 over 85.

25:41.009 --> 25:41.809
Measure this side.

25:45.479 --> 25:46.880
Do you have any underlying health conditions?

25:46.950 --> 25:48.479
Diabetes, hypertension, heart disease?

25:48.950 --> 25:50.180
I have a bit of hypertension.

25:50.350 --> 25:51.279
Have you been taking your meds on time?

25:51.380 --> 25:52.150
Yes.

25:55.450 --> 25:56.589
Any allergies?

25:56.660 --> 25:57.589
History of illness?

25:57.720 --> 25:59.360
No, no allergies.

26:00.360 --> 26:01.089
Relax your legs.

26:04.100 --> 26:05.360
It's 75 over 43.

26:05.999 --> 26:07.029
There's a big difference.

26:09.069 --> 26:10.640
Li Nan, contact the center.

26:10.700 --> 26:12.170
- Okay. - Let him get a CT scan.

26:13.039 --> 26:15.039
- Wait. Hold on, Doctor. - Lie flat, relax.

26:15.269 --> 26:16.170
What's wrong with me?

26:16.239 --> 26:17.440
Why do I need a CT scan?

26:18.539 --> 26:19.710
You might have a dissection.

26:20.410 --> 26:21.509
What does dissection mean?

26:21.710 --> 26:22.579
Aortic dissection.

26:22.650 --> 26:23.650
It's very dangerous. Come on.

26:23.720 --> 26:24.920
No, don't touch me.

26:24.979 --> 26:26.049
I'm fine.

26:26.120 --> 26:27.720
I'll be fine after getting some sleep.

26:28.049 --> 26:28.920
It's just a checkup.

26:28.989 --> 26:30.089
I'm still not going to the hospital.

26:30.160 --> 26:31.620
I know my body.

26:31.789 --> 26:32.720
I don't want to waste money.

26:32.789 --> 26:33.860
Medicare can be reimbursed.

26:33.930 --> 26:34.890
I still won't go to the hospital.

26:34.960 --> 26:35.630
Besides,

26:35.690 --> 26:37.329
having so many of you in my house...

26:37.400 --> 26:38.200
makes me feel very uncomfortable.

26:38.259 --> 26:39.930
- I think I'm sick because of this. - Don't get worked up first.

26:40.329 --> 26:41.130
I'm not agitated.

26:41.200 --> 26:42.170
Get out now.

26:42.229 --> 26:43.940
- Go. - If there's really a dissection,

26:43.999 --> 26:45.640
- it's very dangerous. Sir... - Leave now.

26:45.700 --> 26:47.140
Get out of my house now.

26:47.210 --> 26:48.309
Hurry up and leave.

26:49.610 --> 26:51.110
What kind of person is that?

26:51.339 --> 26:52.279
Dr. Xu.

26:52.339 --> 26:53.850
Are we just going to go downstairs?

26:54.049 --> 26:56.350
No. We can't treat him like this.

26:56.420 --> 26:57.150
That's right.

27:05.759 --> 27:06.559
Mr. Wu.

27:07.559 --> 27:08.930
Mr. Wu, open the door first.

27:11.660 --> 27:12.600
Mr. Wu.

27:17.499 --> 27:18.440
Yang Chi.

27:18.640 --> 27:19.539
Yang Chi!

27:22.569 --> 27:23.839
Break the door down for me.

27:24.180 --> 27:25.610
Dr. Xu, are you sure?

27:25.680 --> 27:26.779
If we don't get permission from the owner,

27:26.850 --> 27:27.749
we'll get a complaint.

27:27.809 --> 27:28.809
Chief will be reprimanded again.

27:28.950 --> 27:29.950
Are you questioning my medical skills?

27:30.049 --> 27:30.850
No, I...

27:30.920 --> 27:31.680
What's going on?

27:31.850 --> 27:33.150
Dr. Xu wants to break down the door.

27:33.720 --> 27:34.549
It's an emergency.

27:34.989 --> 27:35.749
I need to break down the door.

27:42.130 --> 27:42.890
Wu Xuan Yang.

27:43.529 --> 27:44.329
Wu Xuan Yang.

27:44.829 --> 27:46.059
Feng Bei, set up an intravenous channel.

27:46.229 --> 27:47.400
Dong Dong, prepare the oxygen bag.

27:47.470 --> 27:48.170
Prepare a stretcher.

27:48.229 --> 27:49.370
Yang Chi, the stretcher!

27:52.970 --> 27:54.769
Aortic dissection, prepare for a contrast CT scan.

27:54.870 --> 27:56.479
- Yes. Prepare the OR. - Gently, slowly.

27:56.640 --> 27:57.380
Keep it steady.

27:58.610 --> 27:59.579
Let's go.

28:02.079 --> 28:02.749
Chief.

28:03.019 --> 28:04.319
Do you trust Dr. Xu that much?

28:04.779 --> 28:05.850
I'm used to getting complaints.

28:06.150 --> 28:06.950
I'm not afraid.

28:07.289 --> 28:08.089
You just wouldn't admit it.

28:15.960 --> 28:16.860
Did you inform the cardiac surgeon?

28:16.930 --> 28:17.729
I did.

28:17.799 --> 28:18.460
Good.

28:32.479 --> 28:33.150
How is he?

28:33.210 --> 28:34.350
We've already done a contrast CT scan.

28:34.410 --> 28:35.809
We called the Cardiac Surgery Department for a consultation.

28:36.950 --> 28:37.620
Where's Dr. Xu?

28:37.680 --> 28:38.350
He's still in the OR.

28:38.420 --> 28:39.579
He'll be done in 10 minutes.

28:43.489 --> 28:44.819
His heart rate and blood pressure are too high.

28:44.890 --> 28:46.489
Prepare medicines to lower his heart rate and blood pressure.

28:46.559 --> 28:47.229
Okay.

28:47.489 --> 28:48.160
Sir.

28:48.229 --> 28:49.329
This patient complained of severe,

28:49.390 --> 28:50.799
continuous tearing pain in his chest.

28:51.130 --> 28:52.360
His BP is asymmetrical in the lower extremities.

28:52.430 --> 28:53.529
He's been breaking out in cold sweats.

28:53.829 --> 28:54.870
After he fell into a coma,

28:54.930 --> 28:55.999
his heart rate increased rapidly.

28:56.069 --> 28:56.999
His BP is also high.

28:57.069 --> 28:58.670
I suspect it's aortic dissection.

28:58.839 --> 29:00.410
We've already done a contrast CT scan.

29:00.470 --> 29:02.039
He's in the resuscitation room now...

29:02.170 --> 29:03.710
and we've notified the Cardiac Surgery Department for consultation.

29:05.539 --> 29:06.749
Yes, it's that doctor.

29:09.710 --> 29:10.749
Hello, Doctor.

29:10.819 --> 29:12.450
Are you Dr. Xu?

29:12.519 --> 29:13.190
I am.

29:13.249 --> 29:14.589
What exactly is going on?

29:14.650 --> 29:16.989
My brother just called 119 for help.

29:17.120 --> 29:18.259
Why did he suddenly pass out...

29:18.319 --> 29:19.960
and was brought to the hospital by 120?

29:20.529 --> 29:21.190
Don't be anxious.

29:21.529 --> 29:22.829
The patient just had an examination.

29:23.299 --> 29:24.960
We'll have to wait to see what his condition is.

29:26.160 --> 29:26.829
Doctor.

29:27.130 --> 29:28.600
We don't understand.

29:28.799 --> 29:30.670
Was the doctor sent by 119...

29:30.769 --> 29:32.039
from your hospital?

29:32.100 --> 29:33.309
Is she reliable?

29:34.009 --> 29:35.509
The rescue team was cofounded...

29:35.569 --> 29:37.410
by our hospital and the Fire Department.

29:38.210 --> 29:39.210
All right, I'm sorry.

29:39.410 --> 29:40.279
Saving lives is more important.

29:41.910 --> 29:44.450
Then you must have sent an inexperienced intern.

29:44.519 --> 29:45.519
Is she reliable?

29:45.579 --> 29:46.420
Dr. Xu, go in first.

29:46.489 --> 29:47.289
I'll explain to them.

29:48.489 --> 29:49.920
I'm sorry. Calm down, everyone.

29:50.089 --> 29:50.819
I'm the team leader.

29:50.890 --> 29:52.160
I made the preliminary diagnosis.

29:53.130 --> 29:54.390
It was you?

29:54.529 --> 29:55.329
You even made the firefighters...

29:55.390 --> 29:56.759
tear down the door.

29:57.400 --> 29:58.200
I suspect that my brother...

29:58.259 --> 29:59.660
was misdiagnosed by her.

29:59.729 --> 30:00.400
Yes.

30:02.069 --> 30:02.769
Hello.

30:02.829 --> 30:03.970
I'm a friend of the family.

30:04.200 --> 30:05.039
I'm in self-media.

30:05.370 --> 30:06.970
Please understand how the family feels.

30:07.370 --> 30:08.039
They don't mean...

30:08.110 --> 30:09.069
to make things difficult for the hospital.

30:09.309 --> 30:10.640
I heard the joint team is...

30:10.710 --> 30:11.440
Hello.

30:11.509 --> 30:13.350
I'm from Yanbei Fire Department.

30:13.410 --> 30:15.049
We're looking into the details.

30:15.410 --> 30:16.350
What happened was...

30:16.519 --> 30:17.819
the patient refused treatment...

30:18.079 --> 30:19.180
and even kicked them out.

30:19.779 --> 30:21.350
But Dr. Xu wouldn't give up,

30:21.589 --> 30:22.549
so she forced the door open.

30:23.089 --> 30:24.089
If we were two minutes late,

30:24.559 --> 30:25.360
he would've been dead.

30:27.430 --> 30:28.360
But you don't know medicine.

30:28.430 --> 30:29.489
How can you be sure that Dr. Xu...

30:29.559 --> 30:31.059
and the joint team's diagnosis and treatment...

30:31.130 --> 30:31.930
were right?

30:33.999 --> 30:35.170
So you know medicine?

30:35.829 --> 30:37.640
Were you a doctor before going into self-media?

30:39.100 --> 30:40.670
If anything goes wrong,

30:40.910 --> 30:42.009
can you take responsibility?

30:42.870 --> 30:43.640
I can.

30:45.009 --> 30:45.839
What about you guys?

30:45.910 --> 30:46.850
You're delaying treatment here.

30:48.049 --> 30:49.479
Can you take responsibility?

30:57.720 --> 30:59.089
Everyone, that's the rest area.

30:59.160 --> 31:00.329
Please wait there for a while.

31:00.390 --> 31:01.529
We'll let you know once the result is out.

31:15.670 --> 31:17.640
You're such a dedicated escort.

31:17.880 --> 31:19.680
You're putting your reputation at stake.

31:21.210 --> 31:22.479
I've always been lucky.

31:23.450 --> 31:24.680
Are you still in the mood for jokes?

31:25.249 --> 31:26.180
Do you know...

31:26.450 --> 31:28.150
that if something really happens, you're the one who'll be in trouble?

31:28.989 --> 31:30.059
You know...

31:30.190 --> 31:31.519
that the branch has been observing you.

31:32.289 --> 31:33.890
They want to promote you to a more important position.

31:33.960 --> 31:35.029
I'm not interested.

31:35.690 --> 31:37.160
I'm doing well at Shilitai.

31:37.799 --> 31:38.630
I think...

31:38.930 --> 31:40.400
you can't keep yourself from helping her.

31:41.600 --> 31:42.769
Stop talking nonsense.

31:43.640 --> 31:44.870
I have to hand it to myself.

31:45.370 --> 31:46.239
I actually think...

31:46.870 --> 31:48.110
what you said made sense.

31:50.110 --> 31:51.739
I've always convinced people with reason.

31:52.739 --> 31:53.509
Thank you.

32:05.120 --> 32:06.559
Sir, the CT scan result is out.

32:10.799 --> 32:11.999
There really is a dissection.

32:12.829 --> 32:14.170
With colonic ischemia.

32:14.670 --> 32:15.329
Sir.

32:15.430 --> 32:16.799
I've treated this patient before.

32:16.870 --> 32:17.600
He has high blood pressure.

32:17.670 --> 32:18.640
And he randomly takes medicine.

32:18.700 --> 32:19.870
He also lacks exercise.

32:23.410 --> 32:24.180
Inform them that he's critically ill.

32:24.380 --> 32:25.410
Get his family to sign.

32:25.479 --> 32:26.210
- Yes. - Yes.

32:27.910 --> 32:28.809
Let's prepare for surgery.

32:29.079 --> 32:29.749
Okay.

32:29.809 --> 32:30.479
Xu Qin.

32:30.819 --> 32:31.920
Your diagnosis is very accurate.

32:49.729 --> 32:50.670
The doctor is here.

32:50.870 --> 32:51.940
- Wu Xuan Yang's family. - The doctor is here.

32:52.239 --> 32:52.900
Yes.

32:52.970 --> 32:53.640
How is he?

32:53.710 --> 32:54.440
Don't worry.

32:54.569 --> 32:55.509
They're wrapping up the surgery.

32:55.569 --> 32:56.610
He's saved.

32:56.680 --> 32:57.539
Okay, thank you.

32:57.610 --> 32:59.210
- That's great. Thank you. - Thank you.

32:59.309 --> 33:00.049
Great.

33:00.309 --> 33:01.450
Thank you.

33:09.950 --> 33:10.960
Comrade.

33:11.920 --> 33:13.120
I'm so sorry.

33:13.190 --> 33:15.029
We were really too anxious just now.

33:15.329 --> 33:17.299
That doctor is quite good.

33:18.100 --> 33:19.960
I even doubted her earlier...

33:20.029 --> 33:21.130
and said she was unreliable.

33:21.430 --> 33:22.200
Will she...

33:22.269 --> 33:23.269
Dr. Xu is very magnanimous.

33:23.339 --> 33:24.339
She won't hold a grudge.

33:24.470 --> 33:25.299
Really?

33:25.440 --> 33:26.170
I'm really sorry.

33:26.239 --> 33:27.309
- It's our fault. - That's great.

33:27.509 --> 33:28.410
I'm sorry.

33:28.470 --> 33:29.370
We're really sorry.

33:29.440 --> 33:30.110
- Sorry. - From now on,

33:30.479 --> 33:31.710
you can be more polite...

33:31.910 --> 33:32.680
and patient.

33:32.739 --> 33:33.479
Okay.

33:33.710 --> 33:35.110
- Okay, we will. - Okay.

33:35.410 --> 33:36.249
Dr. Xu.

33:39.979 --> 33:40.789
Dr. Xu.

33:41.850 --> 33:42.890
Come in.

33:46.759 --> 33:47.630
Were you looking for me?

33:51.729 --> 33:53.229
Continuing the joint task force...

33:54.329 --> 33:56.569
in the long term is impractical.

33:56.769 --> 33:58.470
It'll also delay your development.

33:58.900 --> 33:59.799
I know.

34:00.039 --> 34:01.910
But Mr. Liu...

34:03.380 --> 34:04.509
I've already talked to him.

34:04.579 --> 34:05.880
It's fine to collaborate with Shilitai.

34:05.940 --> 34:07.079
But your duties in the hospital...

34:07.150 --> 34:08.809
should come first.

34:09.509 --> 34:10.249
Right?

34:11.150 --> 34:12.979
As soon as your training there is over,

34:13.519 --> 34:14.350
come back immediately.

34:17.160 --> 34:17.989
Yes.

34:24.359 --> 34:25.160
Is there anything else?

34:28.270 --> 34:29.129
Thank you, sir.

34:30.399 --> 34:32.100
I'm short-staffed.

34:32.500 --> 34:33.410
Why are you thanking me?

34:46.649 --> 34:47.489
Xu Qin.

34:57.200 --> 34:57.930
This is for you.

34:59.600 --> 35:00.399
What's this?

35:02.169 --> 35:02.970
Something you don't need to worry about.

35:05.640 --> 35:06.700
Can I open it?

35:07.109 --> 35:08.209
Sure.

35:08.270 --> 35:09.069
It's nothing.

35:18.680 --> 35:19.379
You don't have to feed it.

35:19.649 --> 35:20.450
You don't have to raise it.

35:20.919 --> 35:21.750
Just leave it.

35:22.049 --> 35:23.290
It has its own little habitat.

35:23.520 --> 35:24.589
It won't die even if you leave it alone.

35:26.489 --> 35:27.689
Why are you giving this to me?

35:29.989 --> 35:31.160
I think it really suits you.

35:32.660 --> 35:33.569
It suits me?

35:35.230 --> 35:36.230
Are you saying...

35:36.770 --> 35:37.970
that I'm cold-blooded and heartless,

35:38.399 --> 35:39.140
so I should keep a fish?

35:39.200 --> 35:40.069
Is that what you mean?

35:42.569 --> 35:43.439
What else can it mean?

35:45.339 --> 35:46.109
All right.

35:46.180 --> 35:47.180
If that's the case,

35:47.250 --> 35:48.109
I'll return the favor.

35:48.279 --> 35:49.850
I'll give you a gift too.

35:50.009 --> 35:50.850
There's no need.

35:51.049 --> 35:51.980
I don't need anything.

35:53.279 --> 35:55.049
Do I need these two fish?

35:58.520 --> 35:59.189
Take care.

36:11.600 --> 36:12.470
Meng Qin, right?

36:17.180 --> 36:17.839
Don't be afraid.

36:18.480 --> 36:19.310
I'm Song Yan.

36:19.640 --> 36:21.250
I just want to be friends with you.

36:22.750 --> 36:23.480
I'm not interested.

36:27.750 --> 36:28.950
If you can defeat me in a staring contest,

36:29.390 --> 36:30.189
from now on,

36:30.259 --> 36:31.919
I'll be a good student like you.

36:57.279 --> 36:57.950
Go.

37:01.520 --> 37:02.390
See you next week.

37:03.049 --> 37:03.919
See you next week.

37:06.620 --> 37:07.529
See you next week,

37:07.890 --> 37:08.629
Meng Qin.

37:35.649 --> 37:37.089
Why didn't you call me a jerk?

37:38.189 --> 37:39.660
(May Chief Song live a long life, Turtle)

37:39.959 --> 37:40.790
She's cursing you.

37:41.029 --> 37:42.129
You don't have to tell me.

37:43.290 --> 37:44.060
Curse her back.

37:44.129 --> 37:44.899
Go away.

37:49.470 --> 37:50.339
Hang in there.

38:08.589 --> 38:10.759
(Thank you for the dog food. I'll feed them to Xiao Meng.)

38:19.859 --> 38:22.230
(What dog food?)

38:30.279 --> 38:34.509
(Don't you dare!)

38:34.680 --> 38:36.750
(Don't you dare!)

38:45.189 --> 38:46.319
It's not for you.

39:07.450 --> 39:08.279
Qin Qin.

39:08.509 --> 39:09.350
Have you eaten?

39:09.750 --> 39:10.649
I just ate.

39:11.850 --> 39:13.120
How do you like working at the fire station?

39:13.689 --> 39:14.790
It's okay.

39:15.989 --> 39:17.160
It's not convenient, right?

39:18.259 --> 39:19.620
If you need anything, take a day off.

39:19.890 --> 39:20.959
I'll take you to the supermarket.

39:21.430 --> 39:22.359
Okay, Yan Chen.

39:22.430 --> 39:23.330
Thank you.

39:25.629 --> 39:26.399
Are you working?

39:26.529 --> 39:27.270
- Hello, Instructor. - Hi, Instructor.

39:27.629 --> 39:28.330
Yang Chi.

39:29.430 --> 39:31.100
Everyone, stop what you're doing.

39:31.500 --> 39:33.040
Well, I have an announcement.

39:33.299 --> 39:35.370
Who wants to go grocery shopping?

39:35.439 --> 39:36.739
- Me! - Me!

39:36.810 --> 39:37.680
- Me. - Okay.

39:37.739 --> 39:38.739
Why do you all...

39:38.810 --> 39:40.379
want to slack off?

39:40.450 --> 39:41.350
- No, Yang Chi. - No, Yang Chi.

39:41.649 --> 39:42.879
It's rare for me to go out.

39:42.950 --> 39:44.250
- I love you the most. - That's enough.

39:44.319 --> 39:45.319
Yang Chi, I love you more than Da Peng.

39:45.379 --> 39:46.220
All right.

39:46.279 --> 39:47.520
Don't I love Yang Chi too?

39:47.689 --> 39:48.620
That's enough. Stop.

39:48.689 --> 39:49.390
Listen to me.

39:49.890 --> 39:52.259
You're all precious to me, right?

39:52.319 --> 39:53.520
It's hard for me to make a choice too.

39:53.689 --> 39:55.290
So I've decided...

39:59.129 --> 39:59.799
Yang Chi.

39:59.859 --> 40:00.799
I'll send Yang Chi and Chief Song...

40:00.870 --> 40:02.299
to complete this difficult mission.

40:02.370 --> 40:03.029
All the best.

40:03.129 --> 40:03.799
Bye.

40:03.870 --> 40:04.939
Is he going himself?

40:05.500 --> 40:07.439
Yang Chi, you're so busy...

40:08.669 --> 40:09.770
- Get back to work. - Why are you going?

40:12.939 --> 40:13.709
Isn't this...

40:14.509 --> 40:15.879
your favorite shrimp dumpling?

40:20.080 --> 40:20.850
Forget it.

40:21.189 --> 40:22.950
We eat in the canteen every day at the fire station.

40:23.020 --> 40:23.759
I don't have time to make them.

40:23.989 --> 40:25.089
I'll buy some when I get home.

40:25.919 --> 40:27.160
This is Nurse Xu Xi's favorite.

40:27.330 --> 40:28.230
I'll take a few more.

40:29.959 --> 40:30.830
We're almost done.

40:31.299 --> 40:32.230
Let's check the daily necessities.

40:32.299 --> 40:33.430
Okay, over there.

40:39.000 --> 40:40.509
They're out of cereal.

40:41.069 --> 40:41.870
They're out?

40:44.439 --> 40:46.009
There were always here before.

40:46.939 --> 40:49.209
Maybe they haven't had time to stock up.

40:51.950 --> 40:52.779
Maybe.

40:53.520 --> 40:54.689
I'll buy some next time then.

40:57.589 --> 40:58.390
By the way,

40:58.819 --> 41:00.419
have you considered a career change...

41:00.489 --> 41:02.160
to do clinical work at a pharmaceutical company?

41:02.930 --> 41:04.730
Which one? Yunji?

41:05.759 --> 41:06.799
It doesn't matter.

41:06.859 --> 41:07.830
Just tell me...

41:08.000 --> 41:09.129
and you can go anytime.

41:10.200 --> 41:11.500
I'm just giving you a suggestion.

41:11.669 --> 41:13.540
I hope your work...

41:13.600 --> 41:14.640
can be more relaxed.

41:16.609 --> 41:17.709
I like to be busier.

41:17.879 --> 41:19.279
Then I don't have to think about anything.

41:20.439 --> 41:22.279
I want you to be more comfortable...

41:22.549 --> 41:23.509
and happy.

41:25.480 --> 41:26.580
I'm an adult.

41:26.649 --> 41:28.319
I don't have that many happy days.

41:28.689 --> 41:29.950
I'm not a kid.

41:34.830 --> 41:36.730
Zhan Da Peng is so delicate.

41:37.160 --> 41:37.899
He only has very little hair...

41:37.959 --> 41:39.230
and even needs hair essence.

41:41.730 --> 41:42.529
I'll take this one.

41:46.239 --> 41:47.069
Dr. Xu.

41:47.709 --> 41:48.609
What a coincidence.

41:48.669 --> 41:49.770
Imagine meeting you here.
